@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Get to know John Fitzgerald — software engineer, problem solver, and lifelong learner based in the Seattle area.";
}

<div class="about">
    <h1 class="name">About Me</h1>

    <div class="about-section">
        <span class="about-icon">💻</span>
        <div class="about-text">
            <p class="about-lead">I'm a software engineer.</p>
            <p>I enjoy turning complicated problems into simple, reliable systems.</p>
            <p>My work has mostly centered around backend development, data, and automation, with SQL and Python being two of my favorite tools.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
        <span class="about-icon">🧩</span>
        <div class="about-text">
            <p class="about-lead">I like solving problems.</p>
            <p>A lot of my work has involved taking something complicated, repetitive, or frustrating and figuring out how to make it better.</p>
            <p>I enjoy digging into a problem, understanding how everything fits together, and building something that actually makes someone's life easier.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
        <span class="about-icon">🔍</span>
        <div class="about-text">
            <p class="about-lead">I'm curious by nature.</p>
            <p>I'm usually happiest when I'm learning something new or figuring out how something works.</p>
            <p>I don't mind starting with a technology or problem I know nothing about. Give me something interesting to build and I'll figure it out along the way.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
        <span class="about-icon">🎮</span>
        <div class="about-text">
            <p class="about-lead">I like building things outside of work, too.</p>
            <p>I've spent time making games with C# and Unity, tinkering with home automation, and finding ways to streamline my own day-to-day life.</p>
            <p>I enjoy building things simply because they're interesting, useful, or fun to figure out.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-section">
        <span class="about-icon">🥾</span>
        <div class="about-text">
            <p class="about-lead">And when I'm not behind a computer...</p>
            <p>You'll find me hiking around the Seattle area, reading, or performing improv comedy.</p>
            <p>My career is an important part of my life, but it's also what gives me the opportunity to pursue the things I'm curious about, build the things I want to build, and enjoy everything outside of work.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
